{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you enjoy creating your character as much as playing them in games and RPGs?<br><br><strong>Just A Pixel Character Creator</strong>\u00a0was created by fans of character creators, for everyone who loves bringing characters to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Pick from a variety of hairstyles, clothes, eyes, and accessories, adjust their colors, and build characters for your stories, tabletop campaigns, or profile pictures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can save as many characters as you like, and export them as small pixel sprites or scaled-up images \u2014 with or without backgrounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Features-</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a08 different skins </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a014 different eyes </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ different hairstyles </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ different clothing pieces</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ different accessories</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 different backgrounds</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple easy-to-use color palettes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Color-picker &amp; custom color selection</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save, load, duplicate, rename, and delete characters from a gallery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Export images, pixel-art-size or upscaled, with or without background</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4082730?t=1761861111","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4082730?t=1761861111","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082730/7be99ae9aae25d89f7c556be5bfd70b1e0db8d82/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761861111","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082730/7be99ae9aae25d89f7c556be5bfd70b1e0db8d82/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761861111","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you enjoy creating your character as much as playing them in games and RPGs?<br><br><strong>Just A Pixel Character Creator</strong>\u00a0was created by fans of character creators, for everyone who loves bringing characters to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Pick from a variety of hairstyles, clothes, eyes, and accessories, adjust their colors, and build characters for your stories, tabletop campaigns, or profile pictures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can save as many characters as you like, and export them as small pixel sprites or scaled-up images \u2014 with or without backgrounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Features-</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a08 different skins </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a014 different eyes </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ different hairstyles </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ different clothing pieces</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ different accessories</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 different backgrounds</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple easy-to-use color palettes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Color-picker &amp; custom color selection</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save, load, duplicate, rename, and delete characters from a gallery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Export images, pixel-art-size or upscaled, with or without background</p></li></ul>","developers":["ROAM3R WORKS"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082730/2510da28fe2e40bf12582f2a6c5b0c327a652337/header.jpg?t=1761861111","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-bit Linux (e.g., Ubuntu 20.04 LTS or equivalent)  <br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 (2.5 GHz) or AMD equivalent  <br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated Intel/AMD GPU (with Linux driver support) or NVIDIA/AMD discrete (~2 GB VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Requires 64-bit system + up-to-date graphics drivers</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.15 (Catalina) or newer  <br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 (2.7 GHz) or Apple Silicon M1  <br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated Intel GPU (2 GB VRAM) or Apple Silicon GPU  <br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4082730/489506267/ce0ffc97c64cb40aa526e2642a1ee265f3fb5f67/1761240283/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761861109","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4082730/489506267/ce0ffc97c64cb40aa526e2642a1ee265f3fb5f67/1761240283/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761861109","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4082730/489506267/ce0ffc97c64cb40aa526e2642a1ee265f3fb5f67/1761240283/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761861109","id":257221749,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257221749/movie